WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:05.900
A Notice from the Yamayuri Council
When watching
"Maria Watches Over Us ~Printemps~,"
please have the room brightly lit and
sit well away from the television set.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.630
I'm sorry to trouble you.

00:00:13.070 --> 00:00:14.970
Yumi-chan, are you okay with this?

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:17.540
Sachiko's leaving.

00:00:18.210 --> 00:00:19.240
It's fine.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:22.350
These...

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.750
Sachiko picked them up and handed them to me.

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.290
Sachiko-sama did?

00:00:30.990 --> 00:00:33.020
She doesn't need it anymore...

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:38.630
Onee-sama!

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.770
Onee-sama!

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.470
The maidens, who flock to
Maria-sama's garden,

00:00:57.550 --> 00:01:02.320
pass through the tall gates today yet
again with innocent, angelic smiles.

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:07.120
Their pure hearts and bodies are
clad in deep-colored uniforms.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:09.960
So that the pleats of their
skirts are not disturbed...

00:01:10.370 --> 00:01:13.430
...and so that their white sailor
collars are not set aflutter,

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:16.800
it is customary here to walk
slowly and with decorum.

00:01:17.470 --> 00:01:22.310
The Private Lillian Girls' Academy,
a garden of maidens.

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:35.320
Maria Watches Over Us
Printemps

00:01:37.260 --> 00:01:44.530
In the morning mist,
Asamoya no naka

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:51.470
the white path goes on.
tsuzuku shiroi michi

00:01:52.240 --> 00:01:58.980
The birds sing.
Tori no saezuri

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:06.610
We exchange greetings.
Aisatsu kawashinagara

00:02:07.190 --> 00:02:14.060
At times, the clouds hang low,
Toki ni kumo ga tarekomete

00:02:14.660 --> 00:02:21.570
and the sun may grow dim.
hizashi kagerou tomo

00:02:22.100 --> 00:02:29.670
But I will walk with my chin up,
Sesuji nobashite aruku

00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:37.120
for I know,
watashi wa shitteru kara

00:02:37.220 --> 00:02:44.190
that above those heavy clouds...
omoi kumo no ue wa

00:02:44.190 --> 00:02:52.120
...is the blue sky.
aoi sora

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:58.960
The Blue Umbrella

00:03:14.920 --> 00:03:16.450
It wasn't supposed to be like this...

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:21.460
That day, when I accepted the rosary,

00:03:21.660 --> 00:03:26.500
even I knew how terribly mismatched
we were as soeurs, but...

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.880
I never thought my
Onee-sama would turn her back...

00:03:33.880 --> 00:03:36.000
...and leave like that without saying a word...

00:03:47.960 --> 00:03:48.890
Yumi-chan.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:56.060
Yumi-chan, let's go.

00:03:59.300 --> 00:04:03.200
A friend of mine lives in a
boardinghouse nearby,

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:05.800
so she says we should drop by for a while.

00:04:11.650 --> 00:04:12.480
But...

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.980
You'll catch a cold at this rate...

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:18.380
...and besides, do you plan on taking
two buses home looking like that?

00:04:29.860 --> 00:04:32.160
Thank you very much for your concern,

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.160
but I will be...

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:37.690
Oh...

00:04:38.810 --> 00:04:40.600
That's why I'm worried.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.840
And with the way you are,
you'll make your family worried, too.

00:04:45.180 --> 00:04:46.650
Here, give it to me.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:49.610
There.

00:04:52.290 --> 00:04:53.480
Thank you...

00:04:54.590 --> 00:04:55.990
Come on, let's go.

00:05:07.470 --> 00:05:11.460
If I at least had that umbrella on this rainy day...

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:13.900
I really loved that umbrella...

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:19.670
Here, please come in.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:42.630
This is... the boardinghouse?

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.430
Thanks for waiting.

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.840
Men aren't allowed here.

00:05:48.040 --> 00:05:49.510
Women are fine,

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:52.170
but the rule is that I receive
permission from the landlady first.

00:05:52.280 --> 00:05:53.340
I see.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:04.820
P-Pardon our intrusion.

00:06:36.190 --> 00:06:37.780
Were you able to get warmed up?

00:06:38.460 --> 00:06:39.430
Yes.

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:42.020
Thank you very much.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:47.300
I'm sorry, I can do that.

00:06:47.640 --> 00:06:49.160
It's okay. Let me do it.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:50.930
In fact, I want to do it.

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:52.370
Let her do it for you.

00:06:52.610 --> 00:06:55.080
She looks handier than you, Yumi-chan.

00:06:55.540 --> 00:06:57.030
Hot cocoa with milk.

00:06:57.350 --> 00:07:00.080
Yours has sugar in it, Yumi-chan.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:03.380
I appreciate it.

00:07:08.520 --> 00:07:10.990
So, what is your name?

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:14.630
Is she not your friend, Sei-sama?!

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.890
I've seen her face, but...

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:22.160
It's Kato. Kato Kei.

00:07:22.740 --> 00:07:25.170
I'm sorry for the belated introduction.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:26.500
N-Not at all.

00:07:26.610 --> 00:07:27.670
I remember now!

00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:31.610
After the entrance ceremony,
we were grouped together by class...

00:07:31.610 --> 00:07:33.600
...and I mistakenly responded to the wrong name.

00:07:34.920 --> 00:07:38.220
Sato Sei... Kato Kei...

00:07:38.450 --> 00:07:39.580
Similar, right?

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.280
You're unbelievable.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:46.160
You came to the boardinghouse of someone...

00:07:46.160 --> 00:07:47.530
...whose name you didn't even remember?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.520
Because, I had to get Yumi-chan dry.

00:07:56.900 --> 00:07:58.030
Oh, I can do that...

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:00.700
Have her do it for you.

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:13.210
It's so warm.

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.890
I have to cheer up.

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.970
I have to make sure I don't
cause everybody to worry.

00:08:29.070 --> 00:08:31.100
Modern
Japanese

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:53.250
Year 2, Pine Class

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:56.220
Yoshino-san.

00:08:58.500 --> 00:08:59.900
I'm sorry about yesterday.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:04.360
You were worried about me,
but it ended up like I pushed you away, so...

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.240
Yumi!

00:09:10.680 --> 00:09:11.940
Thank goodness!

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:15.580
I was afraid that we were done for...

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:17.350
Please...

00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.310
Did you reconcile with Sachiko-sama?

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.910
N-No... That didn't happen,

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:27.420
but even if it's bit by bit, I figure
I should pull myself together.

00:09:28.000 --> 00:09:30.900
I think that attitude of yours is admirable.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.990
If it were me,

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:34.830
I think I'd probably be acting more mopey,

00:09:34.970 --> 00:09:37.030
or I might be lashing out in some way.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:40.730
No matter what happens with Sachiko-sama,

00:09:40.910 --> 00:09:43.600
I really love you, okay?

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.540
Thank you.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:51.220
I swear! That Sachiko-sama,
making you suffer so much grief...

00:09:51.720 --> 00:09:53.120
...and Toko-chan's a problem, too.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:55.350
Coming between you two...

00:09:58.390 --> 00:10:00.860
No, it's not Toko-chan's fault.

00:10:01.430 --> 00:10:05.260
It was because I lost faith in my Onee-sama.

00:10:06.170 --> 00:10:09.360
Do you want to come to the Rose
Mansion during the lunch break?

00:10:09.740 --> 00:10:12.670
It seems Sachiko-sama is absent today,

00:10:12.770 --> 00:10:15.110
so I don't think you'll have to see her...

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.110
I'll decline.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:22.210
That'd be like I'm sneaking around
behind her back and I don't like that.

00:10:22.450 --> 00:10:23.280
I see.

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:30.710
Then, I'll see you later.

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:31.620
Okay.

00:10:40.400 --> 00:10:42.200
Yumi-san, if you would be interested,

00:10:42.200 --> 00:10:44.260
would you care to come with us to the milk bar?

00:10:44.370 --> 00:10:45.030
What?

00:10:45.240 --> 00:10:48.440
If you are not going to the Rose
Mansion, we would love to have you.

00:10:48.510 --> 00:10:53.640
We have been hoping to get to know you better.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.880
And then, Mii-tan...

00:11:00.050 --> 00:11:02.780
Oh, Mii-tan is our cat.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.680
I've seen a picture of her. She's really cute!

00:11:07.060 --> 00:11:09.060
She's a cross between a Persian
and a Japanese cat, and...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.670
Everyone's being so considerate.
She's a cross between a Persian
and a Japanese cat, and...

00:11:10.670 --> 00:11:11.130
Everyone's being so considerate.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:14.030
Making sure I can keep up
with their conversation...

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:19.040
Would you please show me a
picture of Mii-chan sometime, too?

00:11:19.470 --> 00:11:22.740
Yumi-san, it's not "Mii-chan." It's " Mii-tan."

00:11:41.360 --> 00:11:42.390
You are the worst!

00:11:42.500 --> 00:11:43.090
What?

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:49.260
I misjudged you, Yumi-sama!

00:11:50.040 --> 00:11:52.970
You have no right to say such things to me!

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.610
How can you avert your eyes
from what's important...

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:58.340
...and sit there laughing like a fool?!

00:11:59.410 --> 00:12:02.810
You really are not worthy of Sachiko-sama!

00:12:14.660 --> 00:12:16.600
It's not as if I'm averting my eyes...

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:20.830
Right now, I just want to go
back to my old self quickly,

00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.990
so I don't cause everybody to worry.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.950
Will a Red Rose Revolution happen or not?

00:12:39.590 --> 00:12:41.820
Mami-san, what is that about?

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:48.490
I hear you almost came to blows
with Matsudaira Toko-jo at lunch.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:50.060
What an exaggeration.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:53.200
I know you're right about that,

00:12:53.600 --> 00:12:55.540
but the story has gained a life of its own...

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:58.840
...and now they say you were
slapped by an underclassman.

00:12:58.970 --> 00:12:59.600
What?!

00:12:59.740 --> 00:13:02.040
There are also rumors about
Sachiko-sama two-timing you...

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:07.570
...or that Matsudaira Toko-jo
took your rosary from you.

00:13:07.780 --> 00:13:08.910
So, what's the truth?

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:11.120
They're all lies.

00:13:11.120 --> 00:13:13.380
I want to know what the truth is, too.

00:13:13.920 --> 00:13:16.650
What is really happening to
Sachiko-sama right now?

00:13:18.660 --> 00:13:23.690
I suppose your gaze is always
firmly fixed on Rosa Chinensis.

00:13:30.370 --> 00:13:31.130
Welcome.

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:41.310
I was napping when I suddenly had
a feeling that I would have a guest.

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.140
So I got tea ready and waited.

00:13:45.490 --> 00:13:46.650
Uh, um...

00:13:48.560 --> 00:13:49.750
I know.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:52.660
You are Kei-san's friend's friend, right?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:54.730
Kei-san's not home right now.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:58.360
So chat with me and keep me
company at the main house.

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:03.370
Ikegami

00:14:03.370 --> 00:14:04.940
Ikegami
Would you be fine with milk tea?

00:14:04.940 --> 00:14:05.510
Ikegami

00:14:05.510 --> 00:14:07.580
Ikegami
Um, please do not trouble
yourself on my account.

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:11.770
I am sorry for intruding upon you
without notice the other day.

00:14:12.050 --> 00:14:13.640
My mother would like to thank you as well.

00:14:14.780 --> 00:14:16.220
How thoughtful.

00:14:18.050 --> 00:14:20.250
Might I ask you what your name is?

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:23.250
Oh... I'm Fukuzawa Yumi.

00:14:23.490 --> 00:14:26.480
Really! My name is Yumi, too!

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:27.150
What?

00:14:27.660 --> 00:14:30.490
But with a "ko." My name is Yumiko.

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:33.060
What a great name.

00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:36.900
Oh... I know that sounds like I'm
complimenting my own name...

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:41.830
It seems you're the daughter of a good family.

00:14:42.180 --> 00:14:44.270
What? No, not at all.

00:14:44.680 --> 00:14:49.910
You come across as a sensible,
well brought-up young lady.

00:14:50.520 --> 00:14:52.490
Do you... think so?

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:54.620
It brings back memories...

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.220
That uniform.

00:14:56.690 --> 00:14:58.680
I also went to Lillian, you know.

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:03.360
It has been a long, long time
since I wore the uniform,

00:15:03.700 --> 00:15:06.360
but every so often, it comes back
to me as if it were yesterday.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:11.360
What happened to you the other day?
You were soaking wet.

00:15:14.940 --> 00:15:16.240
I'm sorry.

00:15:16.710 --> 00:15:17.940
I shouldn't have asked.

00:15:18.810 --> 00:15:20.510
No, that day...

00:15:21.550 --> 00:15:25.210
There was a little misunderstanding
between my Onee-sama and me...

00:15:27.420 --> 00:15:29.750
Do you love your Onee-sama?

00:15:30.390 --> 00:15:30.980
Yes!

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:33.150
Then all will be fine.

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:39.500
If you love your Onee-sama,
the two of you will be reconciled.

00:15:39.970 --> 00:15:44.870
After all, she is the person you
deemed to be worthy, right?

00:15:45.110 --> 00:15:46.730
That I deemed...

00:15:47.340 --> 00:15:48.430
That is right.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:54.140
I am sure she will not be so
foolish as to part with you.

00:15:54.550 --> 00:15:56.240
You should have more confidence.

00:15:56.950 --> 00:16:00.790
But though I believe that she cares for me,

00:16:00.790 --> 00:16:02.920
when she is sharp with me...

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:07.720
At times, we speak harshly to
someone because we love them.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.060
Uh, um...

00:16:15.670 --> 00:16:16.800
I'm sorry.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:21.160
Just now, an old emotion
came rushing back to me...

00:16:23.240 --> 00:16:28.180
We have truly come to such a distant place...

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:31.820
I wish I could see you...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.190
How usual...

00:16:42.960 --> 00:16:45.960
...for Yumiko-san to invite someone
into her own living room.

00:16:46.700 --> 00:16:49.190
She has a sort of misanthropic side to her, so...

00:16:53.070 --> 00:16:54.600
It's in lieu of a Buddhist altar.

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:55.230
What?

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.780
Rather than have my late mother be by herself,

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:01.810
I thought it would be less lonely
for her to be in a family photo.

00:17:03.750 --> 00:17:06.020
It's already fifteen years ago now, so...

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:07.810
Then, isn't your father...

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:11.520
...feeling lonely now that you
live at this boardinghouse?

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:15.460
Yes, but my new mother is with him, so...

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:22.090
At first, I also felt like she'd
taken my father from me,

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:28.180
but thanks to my new mother,
I was able to get out of the house.

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:32.870
When I did, I felt as though the
world had opened up somehow,

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:36.080
so I'm grateful to my new mother now.

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.110
The world...

00:17:40.250 --> 00:17:43.750
Right, because I've been able to
meet Yumiko-san and Sato-san,

00:17:43.820 --> 00:17:46.520
and you as well.

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:50.220
The world... opened up...

00:18:11.890 --> 00:18:14.820
Ever since then, I have...

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:18.350
...let even the most trivial words and
attitudes of Sachiko-sama's bother me.

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:22.130
Crying, agonizing, and getting depressed...

00:18:22.630 --> 00:18:23.860
But that was...

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:36.600
I wonder if I failed because I was
only ever looking at Sachiko-sama.

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:37.740
What?

00:18:38.510 --> 00:18:42.110
Because I love her so much and
I don't want anyone else to take her...

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:46.410
I've been bawling, like I'm holding
on to some precious toy.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:50.320
Yumi-san.

00:18:52.030 --> 00:18:53.520
What is it, Tsutako-san?

00:18:54.030 --> 00:18:58.400
Aota-sensei of the middle school
division is asking to see you.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:19:01.200
Aota-sensei?

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:03.570
Faculty Office

00:19:03.570 --> 00:19:04.640
Faculty Office
Pardon me.

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:04.930
Faculty Office

00:19:09.110 --> 00:19:09.840
Um...

00:19:11.610 --> 00:19:14.270
Long time no see. Have you been well?

00:19:14.820 --> 00:19:16.370
Oh... Yes.

00:19:17.550 --> 00:19:20.680
Lillian Girls' Academy. Fukuzawa Yumi.

00:19:20.820 --> 00:19:21.410
What?

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:24.580
It certainly pays to write your
name down on your belongings.

00:19:32.930 --> 00:19:35.800
Lillian Yumi
Girls' Fukuzawa
Academy

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:51.510
This is your umbrella, right?

00:19:52.720 --> 00:19:53.410
Yes.

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:55.120
Yes!

00:19:59.190 --> 00:20:02.860
My late grandpa wrote that for me...

00:20:03.360 --> 00:20:05.890
I had cherished that umbrella for a long time...

00:20:06.670 --> 00:20:09.260
But I had lost it 10 days ago...

00:20:15.510 --> 00:20:20.710
My daughter found it at the train
station last night and brought it home.

00:20:20.950 --> 00:20:21.640
Train station?

00:20:22.650 --> 00:20:24.310
What train station do you think it was at?

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:28.180
Don't be surprised now.
It was the Fukushima Train Station.

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:29.980
Fukushima...

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:35.430
It seems this umbrella has been
on a journey, unbeknownst to you.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:38.860
Take it. It's your umbrella.

00:20:45.470 --> 00:20:49.010
Perhaps that umbrella would also like
to know what you've been through...

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:51.440
...in the 10 days that it was away from you.

00:20:52.050 --> 00:20:54.710
It was really hard for me...

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:57.940
Incredibly hard, after I lost this umbrella...

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.880
But you seem to have recovered now.

00:21:04.090 --> 00:21:06.920
Aota-sensei, thank you very much.

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:09.030
Class is about to start.

00:21:09.230 --> 00:21:13.170
Do your best out there,
Rosa Chinensis en bouton.

00:21:14.570 --> 00:21:15.190
I will!

00:21:20.910 --> 00:21:23.430
My umbrella has come back to me...

00:21:32.220 --> 00:21:34.410
Yumi-san, what was it about?

00:21:34.860 --> 00:21:36.980
My lost umbrella came back to me.

00:21:37.060 --> 00:21:37.650
What?

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:40.150
It was so hard for me...

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:43.160
With the umbrella and
Sachiko-sama overlapping...

00:21:45.230 --> 00:21:48.360
Both had disappeared from before my eyes...

00:21:50.000 --> 00:21:52.240
Just because I got the umbrella back,

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:55.870
it doesn't mean my Onee-sama's
feelings for me will also return, but...

00:22:01.480 --> 00:22:05.820
Onee-sama, like this umbrella,

00:22:05.920 --> 00:22:09.480
I have met many people,
been touched by their kindness,

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:13.620
and I feel I have grown just a little stronger.

00:23:26.870 --> 00:23:28.370
The red rose is the symbol of courage!

00:23:28.370 --> 00:23:29.970
The white rose is proof of justice!

00:23:29.970 --> 00:23:31.570
The yellow rose is the fist of victory!

00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:32.510
Red roses! Ta-ta!

00:23:32.510 --> 00:23:33.610
White roses! Ta-ta!

00:23:33.610 --> 00:23:34.440
Yellow roses! Ta-ta!

00:23:34.440 --> 00:23:36.540
No, no, no, no. That is not how
it should be done, now, is it?

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:37.780
Rosa Chinensis! Ta-ta!

00:23:37.780 --> 00:23:39.180
Rosa Gigantea! Ta-ta!

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:40.410
Rosa Foetida! Ta-ta!

00:23:40.480 --> 00:23:42.580
Shimako is the Rosa Gigantea, but...

00:23:42.580 --> 00:23:44.310
I am the Rosa Chinensis en bouton! Ta-ta!

00:23:44.380 --> 00:23:46.150
I am the Rosa Foetida en bouton! Ta-ta!

00:23:46.250 --> 00:23:48.920
Oh, honestly! I don't know
what you're trying to say!

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:50.350
I'll at least get this part done!

00:23:50.520 --> 00:23:51.090
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:52.460
Next time on "Maria Watches Over Us,"
Next Time "With a Parasol"

00:23:52.460 --> 00:23:53.760
"With a Parasol".
Next Time "With a Parasol"

00:23:53.760 --> 00:23:54.460
Ta-ta!
Ta-ta!
Next Time "With a Parasol"

00:23:54.460 --> 00:23:56.160
Next Time "With a Parasol"
